    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim for a high score of over 10,000 points by controlling a green-haired girl who attacks automatically!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;AutoShot\u201d is a dot-picture 2D action game in which you control a green-haired girl who attacks automatically and aims for a high score while defeating slimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to control</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated clear time: 10 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple gameplay with automatic attacks once a target is specified</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miscellaneous dot pictures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute characters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation description:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ... Move left</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D ... Move right</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W ... Jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E ... Lock on / Lock on toggle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q ... Release lock-on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z ... Pause</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can be freely distributed, posted on video, and released as screenshots, regardless of whether you are an individual or a corporation.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization (e.g., YouTube ad revenue) is also not a problem.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No prior contact or permission application is required.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refrain from altering the game content or using malicious and misleading expressions.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim for a high score of over 10,000 points by controlling a green-haired girl who attacks automatically!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;AutoShot\u201d is a dot-picture 2D action game in which you control a green-haired girl who attacks automatically and aims for a high score while defeating slimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to control</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated clear time: 10 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple gameplay with automatic attacks once a target is specified</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miscellaneous dot pictures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute characters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation description:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ... Move left</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D ... Move right</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W ... Jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E ... Lock on / Lock on toggle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q ... Release lock-on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z ... Pause</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can be freely distributed, posted on video, and released as screenshots, regardless of whether you are an individual or a corporation.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization (e.g., YouTube ad revenue) is also not a problem.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No prior contact or permission application is required.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refrain from altering the game content or using malicious and misleading expressions.</p>",
